@port = 5121
@host = http://localhost:{{port}}

### Login as Customer
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Register a new Vendor
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gordon@example.com",
  "password": "Gordon@123",
  "fullName": "Gordon Ramsay",
  "role": 1
}

### Login as Vendor to get the JWT
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gordon@example.com",
  "password": "Gordon@123"
}

### Create a Restaurant (Requires Vendor JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJlYThhZTFkMi1kNDI4LTRmMmUtOGRiMS0xZDQ2MGIxMTIxOTUiLCJlbWFpbCI6ImdvcmRvbkBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImh0dHA6Ly9zY2hlbWFzLm1pY3Jvc29mdC5jb20vd3MvMjAwOC8wNi9pZGVudGl0eS9jbGFpbXMvcm9sZSI6IlZlbmRvciIsImV4cCI6MTc4OTczMjY4NCwiaXNzIjoiRm9vZERlbGl2ZXJ5QXBpIiwiYXVkIjoiRm9vZERlbGl2ZXJ5Q2xpZW50In0.tFUDIg_2gKcxLYN5tSC6qrHezbRA2oCIjAcoiuw3UXk

{
  "name": "The Royal Gordon Ramsay Hotel",
  "address": "Las Vegas Blvd"
}

