}


### Get all restaurants and their menus (Public)
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant


### Place an Order (Requires Customer JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJiYTEyZjAyNi1iMTYxLTQwMGEtODQ0Mi01ZjBlZGQ0NzgyMTgiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3RAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJodHRwOi8vc2NoZW1hcy5taWNyb3NvZnQuY29tL3dzLzIwMDgvMDYvaWRlbnRpdHkvY2xhaW1zL3JvbGUiOiJDdXN0b21lciIsImV4cCI6MTc4OTY2MjA2MiwiaXNzIjoiRm9vZERlbGl2ZXJ5QXBpIiwiYXVkIjoiRm9vZERlbGl2ZXJ5Q2xpZW50In0.hqIq_q5oDB6pixe4c8kGqDJdlGF0A8NNx14njL1h6yU

